# Play test of Glacier Station (CIPlay glacier_station, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the village on
# the east shore (3.4 m), the observatory on the peak (32 m), the crevasse in the west plateau, the reactor basin north.
# Quest "The Long Night" (20 steps): village, log, tool crate, fuse 1, the domes, the mast, reactor basin, the dead
# controls (3 pages), observatory, its sign, locker, fuse 2, the crevasse's head, its end, the Queen, frozen crate,
# fuse 3, the reactor restarted (7 pages), its vault, the chimneys. (The basin is reached as the player is put by its
# controls.)
island Glacier Station
expect step 0
expect title The Long Night

# The station village: the log, the tool crate's fuse
walk 88 -12 to 74 -12 h=3.4
zone village
expect step 1
read Station log
expect step 2
open Tool crate
expect story fuse 1
wait 1
expect step 4

# Among the domes, up to the radio mast
zone domes
expect step 5
zone mast
expect step 6

# The reactor basin north of the village: dead without three fuses, its vault sealed
use controls
expect message fuse sockets stand empty
wait 1
expect step 8
open Reactor vault
expect message sealed
expect story fuse 1

# Up to the observatory along the trail and the peak's eased south flank
walk 72 -20 to 60 -30 to 40 -30 to 20 -30 to 10 -30 to 0 -40 to -10 -40 to -10 -30 to -10 -20 to -10 -17 h=29.3
zone observatory
expect step 9
read Observatory
expect step 10
open Observatory locker
expect story fuse 2
wait 1
expect step 12

# Down to the crevasse: the Polar Bear Queen in her den, Petrov's frozen crate
walk -10 -30 to -25 -24 to -40 -20 to -60 0 to -70 8 h=8.3
zone crevassehead
expect step 13
walk -70 8 to -78 -6 to -86 -20 to -91 -30 h=4.5
zone ravine
expect message the Queen
expect step 14
kill Polar bear
expect animals Polar bear 0
expect step 15
open Frozen crate
expect story fuse 3
wait 1
expect step 17

# Back to the basin: the reactor restarted, its pool glows, the vault opens
use controls
expect message Three fuses click home
expect story fuse 0
expect shown reactorglow
wait 1
expect step 18
open Reactor vault
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_ElectricPurifier 1
expect step 20
zone chimneys
expect done
